---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import ChatScript from '../scripts/chat.astro';
import '../styles/pages/chat.scss';

import config from '../lib/config';
import { models } from '../lib/models';

export const hiddenFromNav = true;
---
<Layout title="Chat" container={false} additionalClasses={['chat-page']} hideCopyright={true}>
  <section class="chat-header">
    <h2><span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat</span>&nbsp;Chat</h2>
  </section>
  <section class="chat-sidebar">
    <h3>Sidebar</h3>
  </section>
  <section class="chat-section">
    <div class="chat-messages">
      <div class="message user">
        <div class="message-content">
          <p>Can you help me solve this quadratic equation: x² + 5x + 6 = 0?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="message-timestamp">2:30 PM</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="message ai">
        <div class="message-content">
          <p>I'd be happy to help you solve that quadratic equation! Let me break it down step by step.</p>
          <p>The equation is: x² + 5x + 6 = 0</p>
          <p>First, let's identify the coefficients:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>a = 1 (coefficient of x²)</li>
            <li>b = 5 (coefficient of x)</li>
            <li>c = 6 (constant term)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We can solve this by factoring. We need to find two numbers that multiply to 6 and add to 5.</p>
          <p>Those numbers are 2 and 3, since 2 × 3 = 6 and 2 + 3 = 5.</p>
          <p>So we can factor the equation as: (x + 2)(x + 3) = 0</p>
          <p>Setting each factor equal to zero:</p>
          <p>x + 2 = 0 → x = -2</p>
          <p>x + 3 = 0 → x = -3</p>
          <p>Therefore, the solutions are x = -2 and x = -3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="message-timestamp">2:31 PM</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="message user">
        <div class="message-content">
          <p>Thanks! Can you also show me how to use the quadratic formula for this same equation?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="message-timestamp">2:32 PM</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="message ai">
        <div class="message-content">
          <p>Absolutely! The quadratic formula is: x = (-b ± √(b² - 4ac)) / (2a)</p>
          <p>For our equation x² + 5x + 6 = 0:</p>
          <p>a = 1, b = 5, c = 6</p>
          <p>Plugging these values into the formula:</p>
          <p>x = (-5 ± √(5² - 4(1)(6))) / (2(1))</p>
          <p>x = (-5 ± √(25 - 24)) / 2</p>
          <p>x = (-5 ± √1) / 2</p>
          <p>x = (-5 ± 1) / 2</p>
          <p>So we have two solutions:</p>
          <p>x = (-5 + 1) / 2 = -4 / 2 = -2</p>
          <p>x = (-5 - 1) / 2 = -6 / 2 = -3</p>
          <p>This confirms our earlier answer: x = -2 and x = -3</p>
        </div>
        <div class="message-timestamp">2:33 PM</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat-toolbar"></div>
  </section>
  <!-- <ChatScript page="chat" /> -->
</Layout> 